{"id": "320730", "name": "פונקציית ההתפלגות של Y = ln(X²) עבור X אחיד", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>יהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( X\\sim\\mathsf{U} [-{{CT:0}},{{CT:0}}] \\)</span> ונגדיר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y = \\ln(X^2)\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle{F_Y(t)}\\)</span> לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t &lt; \\ln({{CT:1}})\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">פונקציית ההתפלגות</b><br>הפונקציה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ln\\)</span> עולה, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ln(X^2)\\leq t\\iff X^2\\leq e^t\\iff |X|\\leq e^{t/2}\\)</span>. כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t\\lt\\ln({{CT:1}})\\)</span> מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(e^{t/2}\\lt {{CT:0}}\\)</span>, והקטע <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([-e^{t/2},e^{t/2}]\\)</span> כולו בתוך <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([-{{CT:0}},{{CT:0}}]\\)</span>. עם הצפיפות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{1}{ {{CT:2}} }\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ F_Y(t)=\\mathbb{P}\\left[|X|\\leq e^{t/2}\\right]=\\frac{2e^{t/2}}{ {{CT:2}} }=\\frac{1}{ {{CT:0}} } e^{\\frac{t}2} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "%e^(t/2)/(2*la)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<p>המאורע \\(|X|\\le e^{t/2}\\) כולל גם את הערכים השליליים של \\(X\\): זה קטע באורך \\(2e^{t/2}\\).</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["la", "ta"], "nvariants": 9}